.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_SIZE_PACKED 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_size_packed \- return the packed size of one file.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__file_size_packed("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        uint32_t        " "file_number",
.BI "        libmpq__off_t *" "packed_size"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__file_size_packed\fP() to get the packed size of one file.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The function stores the packed size for
\fIfile_number\fP in \fIpacked_size\fP.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a zero is returned and on error one of the following constants.
.TP
.B LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST
File does not exist in archive.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__archive_size_packed (3)
